Package: sbfhazard
Title: Smooth Backfitting for Additive and Multiplicative Hazard Models
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Haozhe", "Li", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "236228545+LiHaozhe-rgb@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: Haozhe Li [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Haozhe Li <236228545+LiHaozhe-rgb@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Alpha implementation of smooth backfitting estimators for additive
    and multiplicative hazard models, including SBF estimators, binning-based
    approximations, and basic prediction utilities.
